@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
[*] --> Submitted : submit [authorised and valid]
Submitted --> Graded : grade [assigned lecturer and valid score]
Graded --> [*]
note right of Submitted
Late is a flag, not a state.
Duplicate submit is rejected.
end note
note right of Graded
Read/download do not change state.
No regrading in first release.
end note
@enduml
